@startuml
title ZK-Rollup Transaction Process

actor User
entity L2_Rollup as L2 <<Layer 2 ZK-Rollup>>
entity Ethereum_Mainnet as L1 <<Ethereum Mainnet>>

== 거래 모으기 및 압축 ==
User -> L2 : Submit Transactions
L2 -> L2 : Batch Transactions

== 유효성 증명 생성 ==
L2 -> L2 : Generate Zero-Knowledge Proof (ZK Proof)

== 메인체인에 증명 및 데이터 제출 ==
L2 -> L1 : Submit Batch and ZK Proof
L1 -> L1 : Verify ZK Proof
L1 -> L2 : Confirm Valid Transactions

== 상태 업데이트 ==
L2 -> User : Transactions Finalized
@enduml
